:Namespace CS
⍝ CongaSharp — APL Cover Functions
⍝ Wraps the congasharp.dll native exports for convenient APL usage.
⍝
⍝ Usage:
⍝   CS.Bind                  ⍝ Bind external names
⍝   h←CS.Init ⍬              ⍝ initialise, returns handle
⍝   CS.Srv h 'S1' '' 8080 'Command' 16384  ⍝ create + start server
⍝   CS.Clt h 'C1' '127.0.0.1' 8080 'Command' 16384 5000  ⍝ create + connect client
⍝   CS.Wait h '' 5000       ⍝ wait for next event
⍝   CS.Send h 'C1' data     ⍝ send bytes (default compression)
⍝   CS.SendEx h 'C1' data ⍬ 0 2 6  ⍝ send with headers/close/compression/level
⍝   CS.Respond h 'S1.CON0001.Echo' data   ⍝ respond to command
⍝   CS.RespondEx h 'S1.CON0001.Echo' data 3 10  ⍝ compressed response
⍝   CS.Progress h 'S1.CON0001.Echo' data  ⍝ send interim progress
⍝   CS.Close h 'S1'         ⍝ close an object
⍝   CS.Shutdown h            ⍝ shutdown root
⍝
⍝ All functions return (rc result) where rc=0 means success.

    ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1

    ∇ path←DllPath
    ⍝ Override this to point to your congasharp.dll location
      path←'C:\Users\stf\Source\Repos\Conga-Sharp\src\CongaSharp\bin\Release\net10.0\win-x64\publish\congasharp.dll'
    ∇

    ⍝ ── ⎕NA Declarations ──────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ Bind
    ⍝ Binds all ⎕NA declarations. Call once before using any CS function.
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_version >0T[] I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_init >P'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_shutdown P'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_close P <0T'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_setprop P <0T <0T <0T'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_getprop P <0T <0T >0T[] I4 >I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_tree P <0T >0T[] I4 >I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_describe P <0T >0T[] I4 >I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_names P <0T >0T[] I4 >I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_srv_create P <0T <0T I4 <0T I4 >0T[] I4 >I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_srv_start P <0T'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_clt_create P <0T <0T I4 <0T I4 >0T[] I4 >I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_clt_connect P <0T I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_wait P <0T I4 >0T[] I4 >0T[] I4 >I4 >U1[] I4 >I4 >U1[] I4 >I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_send P <0T <U1[] I4 <U1[] I4 I4 I4 I4 >0T[] I4 >I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_respond P <0T <U1[] I4 I4 I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',DllPath,'|conga_progress P <0T <U1[] I4 I4 I4'
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Error Handling ────────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Check args;rc;result
    ⍝ Check return code. If non-zero and not WaitTimeout, ⎕SIGNAL.
      rc result←(1↑args)(1↓args)
      :If rc=0
          r←result
      :ElseIf rc=1  ⍝ WaitTimeout — not an error, just no event
          r←'Timeout' 8 ⍬ ⍬  ⍝ return timeout pseudo-event
      :Else
          ⎕SIGNAL⊂('EN' 11)('EM'('CongaSharp error: ',⍕rc))
      :EndIf
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Core Functions ────────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Version
    ⍝ Returns the library version string.
      r←Check conga_version 256 256
    ∇

    ∇ r←Init dummy
    ⍝ Initialise a new CongaSharp root. Returns the handle.
      r←Check conga_init 0
    ∇

    ∇ r←Shutdown h
    ⍝ Shutdown a root: closes all connections, unblocks waiters.
      r←conga_shutdown h
    ∇

    ∇ r←Close(h name)
    ⍝ Close a specific object (server, client, connection, command).
      r←conga_close h name
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Property Functions ────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←SetProp(h obj prop value)
    ⍝ Set a property. value should be a JSON string.
      r←conga_setprop h obj prop value
    ∇

    ∇ r←GetProp(h obj prop)
    ⍝ Get a property. Returns parsed JSON value.
    ⍝ Result: (rc jsonString actualLen)
      :If 0=1⊃r←conga_getprop h obj prop(4096 ⌈0)4096 0
          r←⎕JSON⊃1↓r  ⍝ parse JSON, return value
      :EndIf
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Query Functions ───────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Tree(h obj)
    ⍝ Returns the object hierarchy as parsed JSON.
      :If 0=1⊃r←conga_tree h obj(65536 ⌈0)65536 0
          r←⎕JSON⊃1↓r
      :EndIf
    ∇

    ∇ r←Describe(h obj)
    ⍝ Returns all properties of an object as parsed JSON.
      :If 0=1⊃r←conga_describe h obj(65536 ⌈0)65536 0
          r←⎕JSON⊃1↓r
      :EndIf
    ∇

    ∇ r←Names(h obj)
    ⍝ Returns child names as parsed JSON array.
      :If 0=1⊃r←conga_names h obj(65536 ⌈0)65536 0
          r←⎕JSON⊃1↓r
      :EndIf
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Server Functions ──────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Srv(h name addr port mode bufSize);rc;sName;props
    ⍝ Three-phase server creation: create → configure → start.
    ⍝ h     = root handle
    ⍝ name  = requested name ('' for auto)
    ⍝ addr  = bind address ('' for all interfaces)
    ⍝ port  = port number (0 for ephemeral)
    ⍝ mode  = 'Command' 'Text' 'Raw' 'BlkText' 'BlkRaw'
    ⍝ bufSize = receive buffer size
    ⍝ Returns: assigned server name
      rc sName←2↑conga_srv_create h name addr port mode bufSize(256 ⌈0)256 0
      :If rc≠0 ⋄ ⎕SIGNAL⊂('EN' 11)('EM'('srv_create failed: ',⍕rc)) ⋄ :EndIf

      ⍝ Phase 3: Start
      rc←conga_srv_start h sName
      :If rc≠0 ⋄ ⎕SIGNAL⊂('EN' 11)('EM'('srv_start failed: ',⍕rc)) ⋄ :EndIf

      r←sName
    ∇

    ∇ r←SrvCreate(h name addr port mode bufSize)
    ⍝ Phase 1 only: create server without starting. Returns assigned name.
      r←Check conga_srv_create h name addr port mode bufSize(256 ⌈0)256 0
      r←⊃r
    ∇

    ∇ r←SrvStart(h name)
    ⍝ Phase 3: start a previously created server.
      r←conga_srv_start h name
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Client Functions ──────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Clt(h name addr port mode bufSize timeout);rc;cName
    ⍝ Three-phase client: create → configure → connect.
    ⍝ timeout = connect timeout in milliseconds
    ⍝ Returns: assigned client name
      rc cName←2↑conga_clt_create h name addr port mode bufSize(256 ⌈0)256 0
      :If rc≠0 ⋄ ⎕SIGNAL⊂('EN' 11)('EM'('clt_create failed: ',⍕rc)) ⋄ :EndIf

      ⍝ Phase 3: Connect
      rc←conga_clt_connect h cName timeout
      :If rc≠0 ⋄ ⎕SIGNAL⊂('EN' 11)('EM'('clt_connect failed: ',⍕rc)) ⋄ :EndIf

      r←cName
    ∇

    ∇ r←CltCreate(h name addr port mode bufSize)
    ⍝ Phase 1 only: create client without connecting. Returns assigned name.
      r←Check conga_clt_create h name addr port mode bufSize(256 ⌈0)256 0
      r←⊃r
    ∇

    ∇ r←CltConnect(h name timeout)
    ⍝ Phase 3: connect a previously created client.
      r←conga_clt_connect h name timeout
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Communication Functions ───────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Wait(h name timeout);rc;obj;evt;code;data;dataLen;hdrs;hdrsLen
    ⍝ Wait for an event. Returns: (objectName eventName eventCode payload userHeaders)
    ⍝ name    = object filter ('' or '.' for all)
    ⍝ timeout = milliseconds
      rc obj evt code data dataLen hdrs hdrsLen←conga_wait h name timeout 256 256 64 64 0 65536 65536 0 4096 4096 0
      :If rc=0
          data←dataLen↑data     ⍝ trim to actual length
          hdrs←hdrsLen↑hdrs     ⍝ trim to actual length
          r←obj evt code data hdrs
      :ElseIf rc=1  ⍝ WaitTimeout
          r←'' 'Timeout' 8 ⍬ ⍬
      :Else
          ⎕SIGNAL⊂('EN' 11)('EM'('conga_wait failed: ',⍕rc))
      :EndIf
    ∇

    ∇ r←Send(h name data);closeFlag;hdrs;rc;outName
    ⍝ Send data on a connection. Returns (rc resolvedHandle).
    ⍝ In Command mode with a client name, auto-generates a command handle.
    ⍝ data must be a byte vector (⎕DR 83).
      closeFlag←0 ⋄ hdrs←⍬
      rc outName←2↑conga_send h name data(≢data)hdrs(≢hdrs)closeFlag 0 0 256 256 0
      r←rc outName
    ∇

    ∇ r←SendEx(h name data hdrs closeFlag compression compressionLevel);rc;outName
    ⍝ Extended send with headers, close flag, and per-message compression settings.
    ⍝ Returns (rc resolvedHandle).
      rc outName←2↑conga_send h name data(≢data)hdrs(≢hdrs)closeFlag compression compressionLevel 256 256 0
      r←rc outName
    ∇

    ∇ r←Respond(h name data)
    ⍝ Send final response for a command (closes the command).
      r←conga_respond h name data(≢data)0 0
    ∇

    ∇ r←RespondEx(h name data compression compressionLevel)
    ⍝ Extended respond with per-message compression settings.
      r←conga_respond h name data(≢data)compression compressionLevel
    ∇

    ∇ r←Progress(h name data)
    ⍝ Send interim progress message for a command.
      r←conga_progress h name data(≢data)0 0
    ∇

    ∇ r←ProgressEx(h name data compression compressionLevel)
    ⍝ Extended progress with per-message compression settings.
      r←conga_progress h name data(≢data)compression compressionLevel
    ∇

:EndNamespace
